Canopy String and Combiner Schedule: Corwyn Office Complex PV (PXA-2023-0629)
Brantley Electric Company · Alleron Electrical Contractor Lic. #EC-12306
Drawing E-301 Rev C, 06/24/2025. PV strings, combiner boxes and PV output circuits for each canopy: 18 strings of 17 Ardenne AM-550 modules into two combiner boxes, each combiner to one dc input of the canopy's inverter.
